                            <li class="nutrition-row"><span class="nutrition-label">Fat</span><span class="nutrition-value">29g</span></li>
                            <li class="nutrition-row"><span class="nutrition-label">Carbohydrates</span><span class="nutrition-value">12g</span></li>
                    </ul>
                </section>

                <!-- Reviews -->
                <section class="recipe-panel" p-ref="panel3" aria-label="Reviews" hidden>
                    <h2 class="subsection-title">Reviews</h2>

                        <m3e-card variant="outlined" class="review">
                            <div class="card-pad">
                                <div class="review-header">
                                    <strong class="review-author">GrillSergeant</strong>
                                    <span class="stars" role="img" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">
                                    <piko:svg src="@/lib/icons/star.svg" fill="currentColor" width="16" height="16"></piko:svg>
                                    <piko:svg src="@/lib/icons/star.svg" fill="currentColor" width="16" height="16"></piko:svg>
                                    <piko:svg src="@/lib/icons/star.svg" fill="currentColor" width="16" height="16"></piko:svg>
                                    <piko:svg src="@/lib/icons/star.svg" fill="currentColor" width="16" height="16"></piko:svg>
                                    <piko:svg src="@/lib/icons/star.svg" fill="currentColor" width="16" height="16"></piko:svg>
                                    </span>
                                </div>
                                <p class="review-body">Squeaky, salty, golden. I have made this four times this week and I regret nothing. The lemon at the end is not optional, whatever your flatmate says.</p>
                            </div>
                        </m3e-card>
                        <m3e-card variant="outlined" class="review">
                            <div class="card-pad">
                                <div class="review-header">
                                    <strong class="review-author">HalloumiHalloudon't</strong>
                                    <span class="stars" role="img" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">
                                    <piko:svg src="@/lib/icons/star.svg" fill="currentColor" width="16" height="16"></piko:svg>
                                    <piko:svg src="@/lib/icons/star.svg" fill="currentColor" width="16" height="16"></piko:svg>
                                    <piko:svg src="@/lib/icons/star.svg" fill="currentColor" width="16" height="16"></piko:svg>
                                    <piko:svg src="@/lib/icons/star.svg" fill="currentColor" width="16" height="16"></piko:svg>
                                    <piko:svg src="@/lib/icons/star.svg" fill="currentColor" width="16" height="16"></piko:svg>
                                    </span>
                                </div>
                                <p class="review-body">Hallou-mi, it&rsquo;s me, I was wondering if after all these years you&rsquo;d like to meet. Reader: I met it. I ate it. Ten out of ten.</p>
                            </div>
                        </m3e-card>
                        <m3e-card variant="outlined" class="review">
                            <div class="card-pad">
                                <div class="review-header">
                                    <strong class="review-author">SkewerEnthusiast</strong>
                                    <span class="stars" role="img" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">
                                    <piko:svg src="@/lib/icons/star.svg" fill="currentColor" width="16" height="16"></piko:svg>
                                    <piko:svg src="@/lib/icons/star.svg" fill="currentColor" width="16" height="16"></piko:svg>
                                    <piko:svg src="@/lib/icons/star.svg" fill="currentColor" width="16" height="16"></piko:svg>
                                    <piko:svg src="@/lib/icons/star.svg" fill="currentColor" width="16" height="16"></piko:svg>
                                    <piko:svg src="@/lib/icons/star.svg" fill="currentColor" width="16" height="16"></piko:svg>
