                                </div>
                                <p class="review-body">The trick is a properly hot pan. I went in too cool the first time and got sad grey cubes. Second attempt: proper char, proper squeak, proper joy.</p>
                            </div>
                        </m3e-card>
                        <m3e-card variant="outlined" class="review">
                            <div class="card-pad">
                                <div class="review-header">
                                    <strong class="review-author">MintyFresh</strong>
                                    <span class="stars" role="img" aria-label="4 out of 5 stars">
